# Gate 14: Documentation Cleanup

> **POST-MVP** — This gate is a documentation polish pass after MVP is stable.
> Keep scope minimal: README cleanup, CLI reference accuracy, AGENTS.md refinement.

**Status**: deferred
**Type**: chore
**Created**: 2026-02-04
**Sequence**: post-MVP
**Hash**: #g14docs

